  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to improve macro-fiscal stability and contribute to boosting growth in Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para mejorar la estabilidad macro fiscal y contribuir a impulsar el crecimiento en Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir al crecimiento econ&#xf3;mico en Ecuador mediante mayor sostenibilidad fiscal y fomento de inversi&#xf3;n en sectores estrat&#xe9;gicos, a trav&#xe9;s de los objetivos espec&#xed;ficos de desarrollo de: (i) incrementar la eficiencia del sistema tributario; (ii) mejorar la eficiencia del gasto p&#xfa;blico; y (iii) fomentar mayor inversi&#xf3;n privada en sectores estrat&#xe9;gicos, como energ&#xed;a y turismo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s overall development objective is to contribute to economic growth in Ecuador through greater fiscal sustainability and the promotion of investment in strategic sectors, by pursuing the specific development objectives of: (i) increasing the efficiency of the tax system; (ii) improving the efficiency of public spending; and (iii) fostering greater private investment in strategic sectors such as energy and tourism.</narrative>
  </description>
